[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
budyk is installed with its config in %%PREFIX%%/etc/budyk/config.yaml
(the dashboard on http://127.0.0.1:8080, no password) and the FreeBSD
default rules in %%PREFIX%%/etc/budyk/rules.lua. To start it now and at
boot:

  sysrc budyk_enable=YES
  service budyk start

Its log goes to syslog (/var/log/messages), its data to /var/db/budyk.
Before opening the dashboard to the network, set a password: see
`budyk hash-password` and web.auth in the config.
EOM
}
]
